"description":"FamilyWall: a game changer for families! Revolutionize the way you organize and connect with your loved ones. From shared calendars to collaborative lists, document sharing to finance tracking, meal planning to secure messaging—it's your all-in-one solution for a seamlessly coordinated family life. \n\nWith FamilyWall, you can spend more time doing what you love, and less time organizing it. The whole family can easily access FamilyWall with a smartphone, a tablet or any web browser.\n\nExperience the difference with FamilyWall!\n\n==== FREE FEATURES ====\n\nSHARED FAMILY CALENDAR\n• Use the color-coded calendar to view an individual's schedule, or the whole family at once\n• Set reminders so no one misses soccer practice or an important event\n• Import your external calendar with a single touch\n\nSHOPPING LISTS\n• Share grocery and shopping lists with the whole family\n• Browse your lists even when you’re offline at the store and quickly check items while you shop\n• See items added by other family members. Never forget the almond milk again!\n\nTASK LISTS\n• Create a private or shared to-do list, wish list or chore checklist for kids\n• Assign to-dos to selected family members\n• Create different lists including packing lists, the kids’ camp list, emergency supplies and more\n\nRECIPES\n• Store and share your favorite recipes\n• Easily import recipes from the Web\n\nFAMILY MESSAGING\nPost short messages to one or several family members who will in turn be notified.\n\nFAMILY GALLERY\nShare your best moments with your family and friends in a simple and private way.\n\nIMPORTANT CONTACTS\nUse the Family Directory to rapidly find useful contacts (e.g. babysitter, grandparents…).\n\n==== FAMILYWALL PREMIUM PLAN ====\n\nIn addition to the free features, some exclusive features are available with FamilyWall Premium. You may subscribe to the Premium Plan at any time and enjoy the following benefits:\n\nBUDGET\n• Track your Family expenses\n• Set spending limits per categories\n\nMEAL PLANNER\n• Plan your meals ahead for the week\n• Import your ingredients in your shopping list in one click\n\nFAMILY DOCUMENTS\n• Store and share important Family documents\n• Create private or shared folders to better manage your documents\n\nSCHEDULES\n• Manage your different schedules (recurring or not)\n• Easily import schedules from universities or school via Url\n\nADVANCED CALENDAR FEATURES\n• Google & Outook Calendar Sync\n• Subscribe to any public or shared calendar via its URL\n\nLOCATOR\n• Locate family members and receive notifications for arrivals and departures\n\nAND MORE…\n• Benefit from 25 GB Storage\n• Enjoy audio and video messaging\n\nAfter the Free 30 day trial, the Premium offer is charged on a subscription basis for 7.99 USD / month or 44.99 USD / Year (for the US). For the rest of the world, please refer to the price automatically prompted to you by the application. Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Subscriptions may be managed by you and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your user's Account Settings after purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. The Premium Plan features are applied to the first 5 circles created.\n\nTERMS OF USE: https://www.familywall.com/terms.html\nPRIVACY POLICY: https://www.familywall.com/privacy.html\n\nDisclaimer: Continued usage of location services while the app is in the background can excessively drain the battery.\nBut not to worry, we’ve spent so many years developing our location technology in order to always keep battery usage to a minimum, even while you move!\n\nEnjoy!\nThe FamilyWall Team", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-01T16:24:03Z", "userRatingCount":24674}]
